  "plain": "At a 2024 Senate hearing, Jon Kosloski, head of the Pentagon office that looks into unexplained objects in the sky and sea, said at least two people with firsthand knowledge of secret programs on such objects, programs never reported to Congress, had come to his office. The commentator Marik von Rennenkampff relays this from the hearing, where Senator Kirsten Gillibrand was asking questions. If it holds, it would mean the government's own UFO office has heard from insiders about hidden programs."
